'''Li'l Baki''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained as a Stamp Reward during the [[Baki Hanma Collaboration Event]]. They were added in [[Version 14.3 Update|Version 14.3]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 795
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Li'l Baki
|name2 = Li'l Baki CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Li'l Baki CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Interestingly, Li'l Baki has the [[Metal Killer]] ability, something of a rarity among non-[[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Ubers]]. However, the HP taken is a measly 5%, making Li'l Baki largely ineffective against every single Metal enemy in the game, save for [[Metal Cyclone]].

Li'l Baki's abysmal standing range, DPS, and Single Attack does little to remedy this issue.

